 "notes": [
  "B&S = AWG.",
  "Peak A (Narva): 5 min at 60% duty cycle. Auto-cable figures are Narva's single published rating (no stated basis).",
  "Cont. A (Tycab): continuous at 30°C ambient. Auto cable rated to JASO D609. Derate for ambient: 40°C ×0.9 · 50°C ×0.76 · 60°C ×0.6 · 70°C ×0.45. Bundling reduces further.",
  "Sheath Ø: B&S = Tycab single-core OD. Auto = single-core → double-insulated range.",
  "4 B&S: no 20 mm² lug — use 25, crimp hard, pull-test.",
  "1 B&S: fit-check 35 or 50 lug.",
  "* 5mm figure from Jaydee (matches Tycab on all other sizes).",
  "† 2.5mm: no published Tycab figure — 12 A set conservatively below interpolated ~14 A (Tycab 0.5 mm² = 13 A, 0.85 mm² = 17 A).",
  "n/f = not found in published data. 2.5mm auto (0.64 mm²) is nearer 19 AWG.",
